  two
  three
  four
  five
  |six

=== zC closes nested folds recursively
ref:    fold.txt *zC*
quote:  Close all folds under the cursor recursively.
given:
  one
  two
  |three
  four
  five
  six
keys:   :3,4fold<CR>:2,5fold<CR>zOzCj
expect:
