  two
  three
  four
  five
  |six

=== za on nested closed folds opens one
ref:    fold.txt *za*
quote:  When folds are nested, you may have to use "za" several times.
given:
  one
  two
  |three
  four
  five
  six
keys:   :3,4fold<CR>:2,5fold<CR>zaj
expect:
  one
  two
  three
  four
  |five
  six

=== 2za opens two closed folds
ref:    fold.txt *za*
quote:  When a count is given, that many closed folds are opened.
given:
  one
  two
  |three
  four
  five
  six
keys:   :3,4fold<CR>:2,5fold<CR>2zaj
expect:
  one
  two
  three
  |four
  five
